{1000}{37cYOU HAVE REACHED END OF THIS DEMO

37lThank you for playing my mod, I hope you all like it. Anyway, this is just a small taste of this mod! I'm working on second version of Dungeon Of Quests. Which it contains city of Surnthria and more man/side quests. I hope I'll be finish it soon (I'm the only one who's working on).

37lI know this mod is just way too small for you the gamers. But I'll make it bigger, and better. Hopefully, the second version'll release after few months (or less, if anyone who's gonna join me). However, I'll finish the second version fast as I could.

37lIf you're gonna play this demo again, I have no comments on that. But, this is end of this demo. Yup, you heard me, the END.

37lThis demo is specially thanks to - Terra Arcanum folks (the website), Darkunderlord (worldED tutorial), and all the peoples in Terra-Arcanum Forum who has helped me out (and thx for flaming me out!).

37lIf you have any question/comments on this demo, I would like you to sent it to me. I would be very glad if you found any bugs on this demo, sent those letter to me at...

37leshengxia@yahoo.com OR god8flamer@yahoo.com

37lMy ICQ# is 126109534, if you munna join me (work together) on this mod, just talk to me at ICQ. If you munna help me, all you have to know is read and write [wink].

